{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "My first and foremost goal is to become a successful entrepreneur.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b5061e002af6d678c1f7af3c6d9fcfceafc969ba0d45118e0b63e2c63a414bc3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.04], [9, 2.04, 2.48], [10, 2.48, 3.1]]}, {"text": "Unfortunately, I am still working on trying to get there.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/27fdd860fa39173462a202bd79f4a9e9951ff37362935185958926a2e9b23730.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.66], [1, 0.94, 1.02], [2, 1.02, 1.14], [3, 1.14, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.68], [5, 1.68, 1.88], [6, 1.88, 2.08], [7, 2.08, 2.26], [8, 2.26, 2.4], [9, 2.4, 2.64]]}, {"text": "While my grandfather’s laws make a great guide for running a business, I don’t have a business yet to run.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2698896e58a8a2622c04ac237f1d649c2766980ff0e2b9178b83770df6522c2c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 1.1], [3, 1.1, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 1.7], [6, 1.7, 1.9], [7, 1.9, 2.22], [8, 2.22, 2.44], [9, 2.44, 2.68], [10, 2.68, 2.8], [11, 2.8, 3.1], [12, 3.58, 3.76], [13, 3.76, 3.98], [14, 3.98, 4.1], [15, 4.1, 4.22], [16, 4.22, 4.5], [17, 4.5, 4.76], [18, 4.76, 4.96], [19, 4.96, 5.18]]}, {"text": "After talking with many other successful entrepreneurs, I find that everyone has to find their own path to success, but you can learn from what the greats have to say and let their advice guide you.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f4df915d5f3b0c34e857ce79a9300a8bbf6f83c381e0e8dd7604c3ccf90ee44b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.76], [2, 0.76, 1.02], [3, 1.02, 1.32], [4, 1.32, 1.68], [5, 1.68, 2.48], [6, 2.48, 3.22], [7, 3.88, 3.94], [8, 3.94, 4.14], [9, 4.14, 4.32], [10, 4.32, 4.7], [11, 4.7, 4.9], [12, 4.9, 5.08], [13, 5.08, 5.32], [14, 5.32, 5.56], [15, 5.56, 5.86], [16, 5.86, 6.04], [17, 6.04, 6.28], [18, 6.28, 6.68], [19, 7.12, 7.32], [20, 7.32, 7.48], [21, 7.48, 7.62], [22, 7.62, 7.82], [23, 7.82, 8.06], [24, 8.06, 8.24], [25, 8.24, 8.38], [26, 8.38, 8.7], [27, 8.7, 8.8], [28, 8.8, 8.98], [29, 8.98, 9.26], [30, 9.26, 9.82], [31, 9.82, 9.96], [32, 9.96, 10.12], [33, 10.12, 10.32], [34, 10.32, 10.66], [35, 10.66, 10.94]]}, {"text": "Get out of the house", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/18e4019440618534764d0b1033651f258118ef8411d6e5fa89edd9975c196fc9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.6], [4, 0.6, 0.98]]}, {"text": "I work remotely.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b899476f8bc6f6d5e66869ebd849ca4ef0c69af9fee6dc30cabe0d1541b67e02.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.8]]}, {"text": "My day consists of waking up, working, going to Publix for food, saying hello to the checkout lady and then returning home for more work.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/292821f026db22fea5c29defde6766ff4af7f09d89cbac01b32b4b6468208c58.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.46], [4, 1.46, 1.84], [5, 1.84, 2.12], [6, 2.34, 2.62], [7, 3.0, 3.18], [8, 3.18, 3.38], [10, 3.82, 3.92], [11, 3.92, 4.34], [12, 4.62, 4.72], [13, 4.72, 5.02], [14, 5.02, 5.2], [15, 5.2, 5.3], [17, 5.64, 5.9], [19, 6.16, 6.26], [20, 6.26, 6.54], [21, 6.54, 6.9], [22, 6.9, 7.1], [23, 7.1, 7.26], [24, 7.26, 7.64]]}, {"text": "It is relationships with other people that lead to happy and successful lives.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/cadd250b1ee2a7da3e73d6022c982ae0ce0ead44be17554aaa266956a1d9a505.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 1.98], [7, 1.98, 2.16], [8, 2.16, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.62], [10, 2.62, 2.8], [11, 2.8, 3.18], [12, 3.18, 3.74]]}, {"text": "While I can function completely fine by working from my home office, I need to get out of the house.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/28ac2bbdc33039033f62ff0fe1923d1d4c8dfcb6d191dc378643092045f3d234.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 2.1], [8, 2.1, 2.34], [9, 2.34, 2.5], [10, 2.5, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 3.08], [12, 3.58, 3.66], [13, 3.66, 3.78], [14, 3.78, 3.94], [15, 3.94, 4.04], [16, 4.04, 4.16], [17, 4.16, 4.24], [18, 4.24, 4.36], [19, 4.36, 4.64]]}, {"text": "I need to connect with other people to build a strong business network.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e82f53ce61c56bcda3ef47f34759734ff9519da35acb55d1c2befb448d00c2a1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.12], [6, 1.12, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 1.68], [8, 1.68, 1.86], [9, 1.86, 2.0], [10, 2.0, 2.28], [11, 2.28, 2.68], [12, 2.68, 3.04]]}, {"text": "For me, I build these relationships through my local programming meetups, attending startup weekends, or any other start up events.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ace74b6b27d6eed8fdc036c9298376dea44b38d78fc9b1ae40448ad831ccede8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.46], [2, 0.7, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.38], [9, 2.38, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.42], [11, 3.82, 4.02], [12, 4.02, 4.44], [13, 4.44, 4.78], [14, 5.08, 5.14], [15, 5.14, 5.36], [16, 5.36, 5.56], [19, 5.86, 6.22]]}, {"text": "Keep coding", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a1ed2fb5605efa1c569d43ef61544ec2289fa79f8a0b4fa8d9a14806841d7a9f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.66]]}, {"text": "My day job is freelance coding rails.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f513442d5d97f9b1ffdbe63935b2e3830de07f3ea9390a7c1d64a024f0824e39.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.88]]}, {"text": "I spent 8-10 hours sitting on my computer developing models, controllers, and whatever else my clients need to keep cashflow coming in, but that is boring.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/feeb2056a71a574a8cd8a690e0dbc613f3470af84df1ee7a3d293581a57cc257.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.46], [3, 1.1, 1.44], [4, 1.44, 1.82], [5, 1.82, 2.02], [6, 2.02, 2.18], [7, 2.18, 2.52], [8, 2.52, 2.9], [9, 2.9, 3.46], [10, 3.74, 4.08], [11, 4.32, 4.42], [12, 4.42, 4.7], [13, 4.7, 5.06], [14, 5.06, 5.22], [15, 5.22, 5.54], [16, 5.54, 5.84], [17, 5.84, 6.0], [18, 6.0, 6.2], [20, 6.66, 6.92], [21, 6.92, 7.2], [22, 7.62, 7.74], [23, 7.74, 7.94], [24, 7.94, 8.22], [25, 8.22, 8.56]]}, {"text": "I need to keep my skills sharp and balanced.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/000b07357fa00b16a54f4d60016fa5123552a492ff615d21ca1e69bc6119c60e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.4], [3, 0.4, 0.56], [4, 0.56, 0.74], [5, 0.74, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 1.84], [8, 1.84, 2.22]]}, {"text": "Great!", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/df61b2d87db6edccc92812f18131c9989922d6059caac83b2745b56344d0d2ac.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28]]}, {"text": "I know ruby on rails really well, but I want to be good at lots of different tools, because I have no idea what skills I will need in the future.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9331d990985fc4cd6ca34f23f6963c65586f323fa47f752bad5604f4f9fd16e7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.02], [5, 1.02, 1.38], [6, 1.38, 1.66], [7, 2.12, 2.32], [8, 2.32, 2.42], [9, 2.42, 2.58], [10, 2.58, 2.74], [11, 2.74, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 3.02], [13, 3.02, 3.3], [14, 3.3, 3.52], [15, 3.52, 3.74], [16, 3.74, 3.98], [17, 3.98, 4.38], [18, 4.38, 4.78], [19, 4.78, 5.08], [20, 5.08, 5.26], [21, 5.26, 5.4], [22, 5.4, 5.74], [23, 5.74, 6.26], [24, 6.26, 6.54], [25, 6.54, 6.8], [26, 6.8, 6.92], [27, 6.92, 7.1], [28, 7.1, 7.22], [29, 7.22, 7.3], [30, 7.3, 7.62]]}, {"text": "That is why I play with different frameworks like NodeJS or AngularJS.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/dc7e957f36adf0ab7e11c477a23ad2f96764d32dee609ab22b283577e0e6922b.mp3"}, {"text": "Stay focused on your goals", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a66fdc2868dd7674161a40f42e49fa10bc432bae7c4635c6d346d81f77449a18.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.32]]}, {"text": "I attended the professional speakers Toast Master’s group a few months ago and one of the speakers was in the process of writing a “self-help guide to success” book.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b2b2deb17a6ca90f93336f4de2e87a98d5cbe2b6b5f53a5a70dd8e3333bc10b6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.56], [8, 2.74, 2.9], [9, 2.9, 3.04], [10, 3.04, 3.22], [11, 3.22, 3.56], [12, 3.92, 4.12], [13, 4.12, 4.26], [14, 4.26, 4.38], [15, 4.38, 4.5], [16, 4.5, 4.82], [17, 4.82, 5.04], [18, 5.04, 5.14], [19, 5.14, 5.2], [20, 5.2, 5.54], [21, 5.54, 5.74], [22, 5.74, 5.94], [23, 5.94, 6.14], [25, 6.64, 6.94], [26, 6.94, 7.12], [27, 7.12, 7.38], [28, 7.38, 7.72]]}, {"text": "Her name and the book’s escapes me, but she had an interesting technique for staying focused on life.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/96b0d2bc6c562f99182a531302c5409abaa160b72584e16a0c09fb2b358815a0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.92], [4, 0.92, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 2.02], [7, 2.26, 2.36], [8, 2.36, 2.52], [9, 2.52, 2.74], [10, 2.74, 2.88], [11, 2.88, 3.26], [12, 3.26, 3.7], [13, 3.7, 3.94], [14, 3.94, 4.18], [15, 4.18, 4.5], [16, 4.5, 4.72], [17, 4.72, 5.0]]}, {"text": "Every morning, write your goals in a journal.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f37ca7c8d3fcfa109e1d860fcdf435a0e75741ce379bd3ba9b2ad768341428bd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.68], [3, 1.06, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 1.9], [7, 1.9, 2.22]]}, {"text": "This starts your day off thinking about what you want to accomplish and keeps it focused on detecting signals that may help you accomplish your goals.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f490253a3c304290d41aff263b97583ccb0c604d0295b2e9a9ccee7dbcb767ef.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 2.0], [8, 2.0, 2.14], [9, 2.14, 2.26], [10, 2.26, 2.34], [11, 2.34, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 3.16], [13, 3.16, 3.42], [14, 3.42, 3.62], [15, 3.62, 3.98], [16, 3.98, 4.32], [17, 4.32, 4.76], [18, 4.76, 5.3], [19, 5.3, 5.58], [20, 5.58, 5.78], [21, 5.78, 6.0], [22, 6.0, 6.14], [23, 6.14, 6.58], [24, 6.58, 6.78], [25, 6.78, 7.06]]}, {"text": "Keep a short list", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2e01a120f14a6ee5f3d10f954b618579a71565c5dc773ccb19a5058fdc5c2d96.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 1.0]]}, {"text": "I find myself in situations where I think: “Great!", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/45cb4dae8f6247a57bcb9cd6a95b46186f50c6d0ec59ca84d3a51572237627a3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 2.0]]}, {"text": "I have nothing to do right now.”", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/12e84b5209a64e32028d990d142fd9690f7095b5b94ffa674e332e806cb8a65d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 0.94], [5, 0.94, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.42]]}, {"text": "Bullshit.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/872cb3e25a0bf8052fc4922c28ba6358e5a9a2d167c6ecbb8900eb712952ea7b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42]]}, {"text": "There are always things to do, I find my mind is terrible about coming up with them once its entered that state.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2cf9aee5f782458cef5f587eee6dfb519189477b816f86f5b3293d92600eab5b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 1.02], [5, 1.02, 1.2], [6, 1.8, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.2], [9, 2.2, 2.46], [10, 2.46, 2.6], [11, 2.6, 2.94], [12, 2.94, 3.18], [13, 3.18, 3.42], [14, 3.42, 3.58], [15, 3.58, 3.72], [16, 3.72, 3.92], [17, 3.92, 4.2], [18, 4.2, 4.4], [19, 4.4, 4.62], [20, 4.62, 4.82], [21, 4.82, 5.14]]}, {"text": "Whenever I come up with a task that needs to get done, I toss it into my Wunderlist inbox.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ecf7b76198d7b5c3bec29aa5c8afa0946ad1e21b1e5ccb5a9b6895a9fb5c1da9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.06], [5, 1.06, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.44], [7, 1.44, 1.7], [8, 1.7, 1.86], [9, 1.86, 2.08], [10, 2.08, 2.2], [11, 2.2, 2.46], [12, 2.94, 3.02], [13, 3.02, 3.28], [14, 3.28, 3.42], [15, 3.42, 3.62], [16, 3.62, 3.82], [18, 4.22, 4.6]]}, {"text": "Now I find that I have a moment with nothing scheduled, I can always look their for guidance.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1c033a01a4162067a70089722c9427c09bd4ffe315f963e089427855302feedb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.48, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.24], [6, 1.24, 1.36], [7, 1.36, 1.66], [8, 1.66, 1.96], [9, 1.96, 2.28], [10, 2.28, 2.76], [11, 3.04, 3.12], [12, 3.12, 3.24], [13, 3.24, 3.56], [14, 3.56, 3.8], [16, 3.96, 4.14], [17, 4.14, 4.44]]}, {"text": "I only put short actionable items in that list like: do laundry, ready this article on recommendation systems, or check Zillow for homes.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/52deb133e19d5206ef8f6f6519e73f2c4c05af25323d7882bee8bc8db4163ac5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.78], [5, 1.22, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 1.86], [8, 1.86, 2.24], [9, 2.58, 2.8], [12, 3.9, 4.16], [13, 4.16, 4.36], [14, 4.36, 4.7], [15, 4.7, 4.88], [16, 4.88, 5.32], [17, 5.32, 5.98], [18, 6.32, 6.44], [19, 6.44, 6.62], [20, 6.62, 7.02], [21, 7.02, 7.22], [22, 7.22, 7.56]]}, {"text": "Hopefully by following these goals, I will stumble through life and find myself retired by athange 30, ha!", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a10385e901e13082bf5ee6f3438c867b74a00468e5f81271c08fe1989fc5f373.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.12], [4, 1.12, 1.36], [6, 1.68, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 2.08], [8, 2.08, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.56], [10, 2.56, 2.9], [11, 2.9, 3.1], [12, 3.1, 3.44], [13, 3.44, 4.04], [14, 4.04, 4.32]]}]}